WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.078 line:80% size:94% align:center
Build a to-do app. One list for now. Here's what

00:00:03.078 --> 00:00:05.450 line:80% size:94% align:center
changes, in the order we'll build it.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.235 line:80% size:94% align:center
First, the task list itself. Add a

00:00:08.235 --> 00:00:10.708 line:80% size:94% align:center
task, mark it complete, and save the

00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:12.150 line:80% size:94% align:center
list in your browser.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.511 line:80% size:94% align:center
Then, side by side: the list

00:00:14.511 --> 00:00:15.875 line:80% size:94% align:center
view, and the look.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.152 line:80% size:94% align:center
Completed tasks stay visible, greyed out.

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:21.100 line:80% size:94% align:center
Untick one to bring it back.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.521 line:80% size:94% align:center
Last, the working page. Type a task and

00:00:24.521 --> 00:00:27.000 line:80% size:94% align:center
add it. Empty tasks are refused.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.687 line:80% size:94% align:center
And your tasks are kept after a

00:00:29.687 --> 00:00:31.900 line:80% size:94% align:center
reload. No account, no server.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:35.401 line:80% size:94% align:center
Then it ships, as a page anyone can open. Tell

00:00:35.401 --> 00:00:37.625 line:80% size:94% align:center
your orchestrator what to change.
